{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31448","headline":"昇仙操 · 李羣玉","name":"昇仙操","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嬴女去秦宫，琼笙飞碧空。\n凤台闭烟雾，鸾吹飘天风。\n复闻周太子，亦遇浮丘公。\n丛簧发天弄，轻举紫霞中。\n浊世不久驻，清都路何穷。\n一去霄汉上，世人那得逢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31448.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31448","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}